#. Key:	UpgradeTime_TranslatedName
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Blueprints/NewQuests/DT_AllQuests.DT_AllQuests.Tutorial5.TranslatedName_21_B9A5ECBC40C4C2D839C7B9A851A1986B
